---
import '../../styles/support.css';
import '../../styles/support-direction.css';
import '../../styles/support-v3.css';
import '../../styles/support-v5.css';
import TechnicalFieldSupport from './TechnicalFieldSupport.astro';
import CustomizationSupport from './CustomizationSupport.astro';
import '../../styles/support-v9.css';
import resources from '../../data/resources.json';
import {faq} from '../../data/support';
const entries=[{n:'01',title:'Technical support',text:'Selection, installation & troubleshooting',href:'#page1',icon:'tool'},{n:'02',title:'Setup & customization',text:'Devices, software & integration',href:'#page2',icon:'cloud'},{n:'03',title:'Resource centre',text:'Datasheets, brochures & product information',href:'#page3',icon:'file'},{n:'04',title:'After-sales support',text:'Fault review, repair & return guidance',href:'#page4',icon:'life'}];
---
<div class="ht-support">
<section class="support-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
 <div class="hero-ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
 <div class="wrap hero-layout">
  <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> HITELECOM / SUPPORT &amp; SERVICE</p>
   <h1 id="hero-title">Your devices.<br/><span>Our expertise.</span></h1>
   <p class="hero-lead">Selection, installation and technical support.<br/>Hardware, software and after-sales expertise.</p>
   <div class="actions"><a class="button white" href="#page3">Find product resources <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 4v16m-6-6 6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a><a class="text-link light" href="#contact">Talk to our team <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="hero-product">
   <div class="product-halo" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="product-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
   <img src="/assets/support/tilt-device.webp" alt="Hitelecom wireless tilt sensor with solar panel and antenna" width="627" height="635" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async"/>
   <figcaption><span class="product-caption-line"></span><span>FIELD DEVICES<br/><strong>Wireless tilt sensor</strong></span></figcaption>
   <div class="product-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>+</span><span>DEVICE<br/>CONNECTIVITY<br/>DATA</span></div>
  </figure>
  <div class="hero-bottom"><span>HARDWARE / SOFTWARE / CONNECTIVITY</span><a href="#page1">Explore support <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 4v16m-6-6 6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div>
 </div>
</section>
<div class="entry-band"><nav class="support-entry wrap" aria-label="Support topics">{entries.map(e=><a href={e.href}><span class="entry-index">{e.n} /</span><div><strong>{e.title}</strong><span>{e.text}</span></div><svg class="entry-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a>)}</nav></div>
<TechnicalFieldSupport />
<section id="page2" class="section software software-showcase"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="software-intro"><p class="eyebrow">02 / SOFTWARE &amp; DEVICE SETUP</p><span>HITELECOM APP + CLOUD</span></div>
 <div class="software-stage"><div class="software-stage-copy"><h2>Device setup<br/><span>&amp; software.</span></h2><p>Activate supported devices with NFC. Set the network. Review readings and device status through Hitelecom software.</p><div class="software-stage-links"><a class="text-link light" href="https://www.hitelecom.com/product/app">Hitelecom App <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a><a class="text-link light" href="https://www.hitelecom.com/product">Hitelecom Cloud <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div></div><figure class="software-screen software-original"><div class="software-image-label"><span>HITELECOM APP</span><span>DEVICE ACTIVATION</span></div><img src="/assets/support/app-activation.webp" alt="Hitelecom App illustration showing device scanning and activation screens" width="1300" height="870" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><figcaption>Device activation · Official website illustration</figcaption></figure></div>
 <ol class="setup-steps"><li><span>01 / ACTIVATE</span><h3>Activate the device.</h3><p>NFC activation and local configuration on supported models. Confirm the device identity.</p></li><li><span>02 / CONNECT</span><h3>Configure connectivity.</h3><p>4G / NB-IoT direct connectivity, or LoRa through a gateway. Check coverage and delivery.</p></li><li><span>03 / REVIEW</span><h3>Review device data.</h3><p>Review readings, status and configured alerts. Confirm API or MQTT compatibility for your system.</p></li></ol>
 <div class="software-bridge"><span>Already have a platform?</span><a class="text-link light" href="#contact">Discuss your integration <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div>
</div></section>
<CustomizationSupport />
<section id="page3" class="section resources resources-editorial"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / RESOURCE CENTRE</p><h2>Product<br/><span>documentation.</span></h2></div><p class="lead">Find datasheets and product information by model or sensor family.</p></div>
 <div class="resource-tools" hidden><div class="resource-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter resources"><button class="resource-filter active" type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All resources</button><button class="resource-filter" type="button" data-filter="datasheet" aria-pressed="false">Datasheets</button><button class="resource-filter" type="button" data-filter="brochure" aria-pressed="false">Brochures &amp; company</button></div><label class="search-resources"><span class="sr-only">Search resources by product or model</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="7"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg><input id="resource-search" type="search" placeholder="Search a product or model, e.g. TS180C" autocomplete="off"/></label></div>
 <div class="resource-meta"><span id="resource-count" role="status">17 resources</span><span>Product information · Direct file access</span></div>
 <div class="resource-list">{resources.map(r=><article class="resource-row" data-resource data-kind={r.kind} data-featured={String(r.featured)} data-search={r.label+' '+r.href+' '+r.kind}>
  <div class="document-top"><span>{r.kind==='datasheet'?'PRODUCT DATASHEET':'BROCHURE / COMPANY'}</span><span class="file-info">{r.format} <span>{r.size}</span></span></div><div class="resource-name"><p class="resource-model">{r.label.includes(' · ')?r.label.split(' · ')[0]:'HITELECOM'}</p><h3>{r.label.includes(' · ')?r.label.split(' · ')[1]:r.label}</h3></div><a href={r.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label={'Open '+r.label+' '+r.format} class="resource-open"><span>Open document</span><svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a>
 </article>)}</div>
 <div id="resource-empty" hidden><h3>No matching resources.</h3><p>Try a product family or send us the model you need.</p><button type="button" id="resource-clear">Clear filters</button> <a href="#contact">Request a document ↗</a></div>
 <button id="more-resources" type="button" class="resource-more" hidden>Show all resources <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button>
 <p class="resource-language-note">English source documents. Translated product labels do not change the language of the linked files.</p>
 <div class="resource-request"><p>Looking for a manual, firmware or a custom configuration?</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Request the correct file <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div>
</div></section>
<section id="page4" class="section aftersales service-editorial"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / AFTER-SALES SUPPORT</p><h2>After-sales<br/><span>support.</span></h2></div><p class="lead">Send the product model and fault details. We review the issue and confirm service options, costs and arrangements.</p></div>
 <div class="support-paths"><article><span class="path-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><p class="eyebrow">DEVICE &amp; DATA ISSUES</p><h3>Configuration<br/>&amp; troubleshooting.</h3><p>Unexpected readings, connectivity changes or setup questions. Start with the device model and what changed.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Request technical support <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></article><article><span class="path-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><p class="eyebrow">EQUIPMENT &amp; SERVICE</p><h3>Repair &amp;<br/>replacement review.</h3><p>Share the product identification, purchase reference and fault details so the applicable options can be reviewed.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Discuss a service request <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></article></div>
 <ol class="review-process"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Describe the issue.</h3><p>Model, device ID, symptoms and relevant records.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Review the device.</h3><p>Configuration, operating conditions and diagnostic information.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Agree on service.</h3><p>Scope, applicable costs and return or service arrangements.</p></div></li></ol>
 <div class="service-followup" id="technical-follow-up"><h3>Technical follow-up.</h3><p>Configuration review and checks on the reported issue after repair or replacement, according to the agreed service scope.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact" data-support-topic="After-sales follow-up">Discuss follow-up <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div>
 <p class="return-note"><span>BEFORE YOU SHIP</span> Please obtain return instructions first. Service eligibility and terms depend on the product, order and review.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section faq faq-editorial" id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">SUPPORT FAQ</p><h2>Answers for<br/><span>your project.</span></h2><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Talk to Hitelecom <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div><div class="faq-list">{faq.map(f=><details><summary>{f.q}<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>{f.a}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section support-contact contact-editorial" id="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="contact-title"><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT SUPPORT</p><h2>How can<br/><span>we help?</span></h2></div><div class="contact-layout"><div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">TALK TO HITELECOM</p><h3>Tell us about your<br/>device or project.</h3><p>Include the model, installation location and a short description of your question or issue.</p><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:sales@hitelecom.cn">sales@hitelecom.cn <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a><a class="contact-phone" href="tel:+86-18616602589">+86-18616602589</a><div class="contact-proof"><span>Product guidance</span><span>Technical review</span><span>Service enquiries</span></div></div>
 <div class="support-form-card"><h3>Start a support enquiry</h3><p>Prepare an email with the details below.</p><form id="support-form"><div class="fields"><label>Your name *<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100"/></label><label>Company<input name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="140"/></label><label class="full">Business email *<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200"/></label><label>Help with<select name="topic"><option>Technical support</option><option>Product documentation</option><option>Device setup &amp; connectivity</option><option>Cloud &amp; integration</option><option>Repair or replacement</option><option>Hardware customization</option><option>Software customization</option><option>Remote support</option><option>Telephone support</option><option>On-site support</option><option>After-sales follow-up</option><option>OEM / ODM enquiry</option></select></label><label>Product / model<input name="model" placeholder="e.g. H310-TS180C" maxlength="160"/></label><label class="full">How can we help? *<textarea name="message" rows="4" required maxlength="4000" placeholder="Issue or requirement, installation country, and relevant device details…"></textarea></label></div><button type="submit" class="button" disabled>Prepare support email <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></button><p class="form-note">Review the draft, then send it with your email app.<br/>Please do not include passwords or access keys.</p></form><noscript><p>Email your request directly to <a href="mailto:sales@hitelecom.cn">sales@hitelecom.cn</a>.</p></noscript><div id="support-review" hidden><p><strong>Your draft is ready. Nothing has been sent.</strong></p><pre id="support-draft"></pre><a id="support-email" class="button" href="mailto:sales@hitelecom.cn">Open email draft ↗</a><button id="support-copy" type="button">Copy request</button><p id="support-copy-status" role="status"></p></div></div>
</div></div></section>
<div class="wrap support-next"><span>EXPLORE HITELECOM</span><a href="https://www.hitelecom.com/solution">Find your monitoring solution <svg class="diagonal-arrow" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></a></div>
</div>
<script>import '../../scripts/support.js';</script>
